    {
      "title": "Welcome",
      "type": "sticky",
      "text": "**ExoDeck** is a fast, AI ready, local-first Personal Knowledge Management (PKM) system, personal browser start page and dashboard.\n\nIt combines quick web link collections, rich Markdown notes, freeform Excalidraw whiteboards, and structured BPMN process diagrams into a single, unified interface.",
